Backport of https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay/commit/b7bc7cfe4ee97539b586be9aa7a184f8934e3f53
(FDH2/UxPlay#586) to 1.73.6, whose dns_sd backend is lib/dnssd.c and always
external (Avahi's avahi-compat-libdns_sd), so the EXTERNAL_DNS_SD guard is dropped.

UxPlay registers _raop and _airplay with DNSServiceRegister() but never calls
DNSServiceProcessResult(), so Avahi's compat layer never reads its two system-bus
connections and dbus-broker queues every NameOwnerChanged signal for them.

